{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a certain world, God has been gradually eradicating all living creatures from the world, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >for reasons unknown, using his divine authority.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only surviving pig, in his solitude, vows to rebel against God.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The former living creatures are now just souls. Summoning their last bit of strength, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >they present themselves to the pig as the path to God, entrusting their future to him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Overview</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control the main character, a pig, and head upwards while jumping over objects in front of you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a 3D action game in which you head upwards while avoiding flamethrowers along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Pass First SavePoint","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3821900/89a45d9c82b53771e85d25df24633fc60eac792b.jpg"},{"name":"First Charred","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3821900/318d63268c374bb4804bfc14e4f4f6200d25cc83.jpg"},{"name":"Jump 100","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3821900/2ba707adb3819cbf48abd9227e79f1c360184928.jpg"},{"name":"Jump 500","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3821900/4c7531e6b1fe234fbff42f79277263bfc47f0236.jpg"},{"name":"Jump 1000","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3821900/3b9919e9f4a8fdbf855301ca590f099e32bacb32.jpg"},{"name":"Pass All SavePoints","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3821900/b85c60baec8277af37fea1dedacfd850e22ded7f.jpg"},{"name":"Goal","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images